                    {
                        "sense_id": "1723bcce-7750-3a32-8c02-f55d9a7fba9d",
                        "entry_id": "20d36963-1fb5-3a9f-8e00-474264c8f8c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The bright reflection of moonlight on a body of water."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "poetic",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d28ff887-f5c2-43fc-899f-a678c837429d",
                                "sense_id": "1723bcce-7750-3a32-8c02-f55d9a7fba9d",
                                "text": "Moonglade and sunglade on ocean or lake have a haunting and suggestive beauty. The reflected lane of light supplies what the mind craves in a picture—a path that seems to lead to some place of unknown and longed-for happiness […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2bd5b65-111d-4c6d-b73c-88888ec6addb",
                                "sense_id": "1723bcce-7750-3a32-8c02-f55d9a7fba9d",
                                "text": "Heaven was full of silent stars, and there was a moonglade on the water that stretched almost from him to Rose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb20d348-4077-487c-9919-b3d54bee65a5",
                                "sense_id": "1723bcce-7750-3a32-8c02-f55d9a7fba9d",
                                "text": "The sea shimmered there, and turned, at last, into a moonglade, through which she glided handsomely."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdef6e2c-c252-4b11-98cf-98670485f56a",
                                "sense_id": "1723bcce-7750-3a32-8c02-f55d9a7fba9d",
                                "text": "a double moonglade on the Auroral Ocean"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
